The second line contains $n$ integers $a_i$ ($1 \le a_i \le 10^5$).', 'Print the maximum number of points.', '$1 \le n \le 10^5$, $1 \le a_i \le 10^5$', '[{"input":"2\n1 2","output":"2"}]'::jsonb, 'O(N · X)');
